# Shell scripts and the Dockerfile run inside a Linux container. A CRLF
# working tree ships \r into them, and `set -eu\r` dies with an unreadable
# error. Pin LF regardless of the platform the tree is checked out on.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
